  "reason": "The initial plan identified that using CLS token for DeBERTa embedding extraction leads to a severe degradation in performance (val log loss from 0.4062 to 0.9019) and that switching to mean pooling should improve XGBoost's validation log loss from 0.2983 to approximately 0.27-0.28. This module-level modification directly addresses the root cause in the 'training_evaluation' module, specifically in the extract_embeddings function, and is well-supported by historical experiments showing similar improvements. No changes are needed in data processing or model design as the fix is purely post-processing.",
  "module": ["training_evaluation"],
